\item a \code{netreg}, from \code{estimate_mrqap()}, simulates outcome networks from
the fitted model and compares a network statistic, \code{FUN}, on each
with the statistic on the observed network.
}
\item \code{test_distributions()} compares the data simulated from two models.
It is also a generic, with a method for two \code{diffs_model} objects.
